{"version":1,"content":"<p>粵菜博大精深，當中的廣府菜與潮汕菜更捧場者眾，分別講求清鮮火候，以及精湛刀工和味道。</p><p>近日有高級中菜廳推出洋溢廣府菜元素的新菜單，還有新派潮粵餐廳供應創意潮汕菜，讓食饕以味蕾感受摩登地方珍饈的獨特味力。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;金鐘：新派潮州風味</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T06:21:50.169635+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:00:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:15:11.817804+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:15:11.817804+00:00","content_hash":"820cc59e579d4e8d1a088565e7c5608fef4b9c7fb9edbf3702e1b0032c3ae3d0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}